                <invention-title lang="fr">COMMUNICATION D'UNE CONFIGURATION DE FORMATION DE RÉSEAU NEURONAL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">COMMUNICATING A NEURAL NETWORK FORMATION CONFIGURATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Techniques and apparatuses are described for enabling base station-user equipment messaging regarding deep neural networks. A network entity (base station 121, core network server 320) identifies (1505) two or more channels that are quasi-correspondent channels. The network entity transmits (1510), to a user equipment (UE) (110), an indication of the quasi-correspondent channels. The network entity transmits (1515), to the UE, an indication of a neural network formation configuration for one of the quasi-correspondent channels.</p>
            </abstract>
